[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_owbgm")
dialogue_id = "mq_4_10_begin"
record_title = "Era 四: The Enlightened One Reborn"
text = "PAGE: explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY)
explorer: I just returned from one of the old shards.
explorer: That place is barely holding on.
explorer: But I bring news.
scribe: Such is the fate of this doomed world.
scribe: Still, what is this news you speak of?
explorer: It is about the Enlightened One's Abode.
explorer: It's no longer alone!
scribe: What do you mean?
scribe: Did settlers from another shard lay claim to the sacred ground?
explorer: No, no, nothing like that!
explorer: Another shard drifted into it.
explorer: A barren piece of rock, completely devoid of people.
explorer: They are one landmass now.
scribe: One landmass, unified?
scribe: The shards are coming together?
scribe: When did this happen?
explorer: I heard it was a few years ago.
explorer: You know how it is these days.
explorer: No one travels around anymore.
explorer: Even a famous shard like that probably gets a dozen outsiders a year.
scribe: They didn't think to send word to the Haven, when our whole world may be changed by this?
scribe: I suppose even the monks have lost faith.
scribe: But not I.
scribe: Not anymore.
scribe: I have carried the torch since my teacher and his teachers before him, and it is finally time to reignite the flame.
scribe: This is a sign of the fractured spirit gathering its pieces.
explorer: That's exciting!
explorer: I'm going to the shard to see how it's changed.
explorer: Do you want to send a message to the monks there?
scribe: More than that.
scribe: I have a mission for you.
scribe: If the land is being reborn, then so is our guide.
scribe: Everything is part of the pattern.
scribe: A child must have been born at the exact moment the earth shook and the shards became one.
explorer: A child?
scribe: The Avatar that has been foretold.
scribe: The Enlightened One reborn in human form.
scribe: You must retrieve this child.
scribe: From this day on, to raise the Enlightened One's vessel shall be my life's duty.
scribe: To protect the Avatar before the world corrupts them.
explorer: I don't know how I can track down a child born years ago, but I'll ask the monks about it.
scribe: You must do it.
scribe: If it takes years, you must do it.
scribe: At any cost.
scribe: It is what will secure the future of our world."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
